	(gr_text "The design is according to:\nhttps://jlcpcb.com/help/article/243-BGA-Design-Guidelines---PCB-Layout-Recommendations-for-BGA-packages\n\nThat means:\n0.25mm BGA pad and Via-In-Pad outer diameter\n0.15mm Via holes\n0.09mm Minimum for normal tracks\n0.076mm Tracks passing between BGA pads (infrequent)\n"
